{
  "info": {
    "name": "heart-model \u2014 MLOps",
    "description": "Disparo del workflow ml_ci_cd via repository_dispatch y pruebas del modelo desplegado.\n\nEl backend sirve las tres versiones del modelo (25 %, 50 %, 100 %) desde una sola\nimagen: la version se elige con el parametro ?version=.\n\nVariables requeridas (ver heart-model.postman_environment.json):\n- github_user, github_repo, github_token (secret)\n- api_url (URL del backend en Render o local)\n- dataset_url_25 / dataset_url_50 / dataset_url_100",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "payload",
      "value": "{\"age\":64,\"sex\":1,\"cp\":3,\"trestbps\":120,\"chol\":267,\"fbs\":0,\"restecg\":0,\"thalach\":99,\"exang\":1,\"oldpeak\":1.8,\"slope\":1,\"ca\":2,\"thal\":2}"
    },
    {
      "key": "score_25",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "score_50",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "score_100",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Disparar workflow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "repository_dispatch \u2014 las 3 versiones (25/50/100)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('GitHub acepta el dispatch (204)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "console.log('La imagen resultante contendra los modelos 25, 50 y 100.');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{github_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/vnd.github+json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_type\": \"ml_ci_cd\",\n  \"client_payload\": {\n    \"dataseturl_25\": \"{{dataset_url_25}}\",\n    \"dataseturl_50\": \"{{dataset_url_50}}\",\n    \"dataseturl_100\": \"{{dataset_url_100}}\",\n    \"sha\": \"heart-disease-all\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://api.github.com/repos/{{github_user}}/{{github_repo}}/dispatches",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "api",
                "github",
                "com"
              ],
              "path": [
                "repos",
                "{{github_user}}",
                "{{github_repo}}",
                "dispatches"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "repository_dispatch \u2014 un solo dataset 25%",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('GitHub acepta el dispatch (204)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
